- [x] Add Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite for Affordable Image Analysis
- [x] Add in an update checker against mothership, so the user can pull down llamabot & llamapress updates without needing to use the terminal
- [x] Add in a new route for transferring images from the mothership to here.

